normalize ex y:qlt ((({3}:qlt & y) != 0) && (({3}:qlt & y') != 0)).
valid all y:qlt ((({3}:qlt & y) = 0) || (({3}:qlt & y') = 0)).
normalize ((({3}:qlt & {3}:qlt) != 0) && (({3}:qlt & {3}:qlt') != 0)).
normalize ((({3}:qlt & {5}:qlt) != 0) && (({3}:qlt & {5}:qlt') != 0)).
normalize ex y:qlt ((({[0,1]}:qlt & y) != 0) && (({[0,1]}:qlt & y') != 0)).
normalize ((({[0,1]}:qlt & {0}:qlt) != 0) && (({[0,1]}:qlt & {0}:qlt') != 0)).
